   "Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], "Text", \
"BlockQuote",
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1fc812fc-4c51-134f-a13a-37a5af305099"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.2. Why caution is needed", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"1c971650-4e39-d04f-9718-9cc787165a62"],

Cell["\<\
This is a serious philosophical proposal, but it is not established \
neuroscience. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3171fa4f-a013-3a4b-a09c-83e528161df9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13.3. Productive formal direction", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"72a5d9e1-c215-514c-83c3-8a6d3856169a"],

Cell["\<\
One possible path is to define a consciousness functional depending on: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aecf0f11-d43c-5440-9042-2af573d0fcfd"],

Cell["recursion depth,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a24eb0fc-b884-5e4d-85a5-b9a27dd7d72e"],

Cell["memory integration,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e5b1f48a-9799-184e-a1e4-5416439c5529"],

Cell["cross-scale coherence,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"12e2e3a1-ae12-4f45-8ade-713a188d875c"],

Cell["self-model fidelity,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f1e6bbf6-7925-d24e-a11b-99d03aadcfcc"],

Cell["closure persistence.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"a70b5a88-725c-7946-a44f-fefbddbbbf0e"],

Cell["This is a research program, not yet a completed result. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4ea569ee-131b-584b-9779-9a40896564d7"],

